{"data":{"body":"**P2: Close the sampling scope before ending the span.** `openScope` publishes a thread-scoped system property, while `Span.end()` synchronously invokes span processors/exporters. Keeping the property active during `end()` causes any spans those callbacks create to inherit this execution's durable sampling decision. Scope only `startSpan()`, then end the root after the scope closes.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74iRPb","finding_digest":"cdc830aeac841643715eee36a3bb84e5e1e8364ebaa16364d1e8d6fc75e9b251","finding_id":"arf_v1_zxedblvmqqleg4k65y3kho4e4x","finding_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport.java::exportexecutionroot::sampling-scope-leak","identity_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport.java::exportexecutionroot::sampling-scope-leak","line":52,"observation_digest":"f9244f9a696bea234439d5038d4f20fb7c3d2d331cdf562d3a09e3a8951e6b32","observation_id":"aro_v1_7ese7gtjnpvcgrbz2uby2tza7n","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/OtelPluginSupport.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-02T20:51:27Z","review_id":"arr_v1_jpaoqq77okd3bowaw5hm5mwhdh","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"a724676c187534e03645261ad968c41c6d2e6704","reviewer":"codex","start_line":49,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_3tscj5eelpln26bdjmxsgsuwm4"},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_civtx6inavu4jwczovdz7zq6wn","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-02T20:51:27Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
